    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Reynolds Estate Agents are delighted to present this superb 4-bedroom semi-detached residence extending to c. 118 m2 ideally positioned on an elevated site just 1km from Strandhill Village and 8km from Sligo Town.\n\nPresented in turnkey condition and being sold as seen, this spacious family home boasts an extra-large front driveway with ample parking and a generous rear garden enjoying stunning views overlooking the iconic Knocknarea Mountain.\n\nThe property offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout and is ideally located close to Strandhill`s renowned beach, cafés, schools, sporting amenities and coastal walks.\n\n Excellent transport links are available via the Bus Éireann S2 service, which operates hourly between Strandhill and Sligo Town from early morning until late evening.\n\nA fantastic opportunity to acquire a quality home in one of Sligo`s most sought-after coastal locations.\n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\n\nHall Entrance\n\nLounge - 5.98m (19'7\") x 3.56m (11'8\")\nopen fire\nbay window\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 5.56m (18'3\") x 4.36m (14'4\")\nbuilt-in-kitchen\npatio door to rear garden\n\nGuest Toilet - 2.13m (7'0\") x 0.74m (2'5\")\nwc & whb\n\nGround Floor\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.52m (8'3\") x 2.51m (8'3\")\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.27m (14'0\") x 3.41m (11'2\")\n\nEn-Suite - 1.81m (5'11\") x 1.68m (5'6\")\nwc, whb & electric shower\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.27m (14'0\") x 2.47m (8'1\")\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.99m (9'10\") x 2.67m (8'9\")\n\nBathroom - 2.13m (7'0\") x 1.75m (5'9\")\nwc, whb & shower/bath\n\nHot Press\nshelved\n\nNotice\nThese particulars are issued by David Reynolds Estate Agent on the understanding that any negotiations relating to the property are conducted through them. Whilst every care is taken in preparing particulars, the Company do not hold themselves responsible for any inaccuracy in the particulars or the terms of the properties referred to or for any expense that may be incurred in visiting same should it prove unsuitable or to have been let, sold or withdrawn. Applicants are advised to make an appointment through us before viewing and are respectfully requested to report their opinion after inspection."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Oil Fired Central Heating </li><li> Open Fire in Lounge </li><li> PVC Double Glazed Windows </li><li> Guest Toilet, En-Suite & Bathroom </li><li> Spacious Driveway to Front </li><li> Large Garden to Rear with views of Knocknarae </li><li> Property being sold \"as seen\" in Turnkey Finish </li><li> Minutes walk from the village of Strandhill </li><li> Excellent public transport links via S2 bus service </li><li> Highly sought-after coastal location</li></ul>"
      },
